## SQ-FSD-08 | cook_end_1_21 template has the hanging canvas sign (200 -60 540)
@group B
@commands Look at the cook house piece with a hanging canvas sign (`cook_end_1_21`, via `/cdevplace` or many cooks)
@pass The sign is present, hanging from a ceiling
@fails CD jar
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> place template farmers_structures:cook_houses/cook_end_1_21 200 -60 540
expect Loaded template
> zq count 195 -64 535 235 -30 575 farmersdelight:hanging_canvas_sign
expect \[zq\] count farmersdelight:hanging_canvas_sign: [1-9]
look the sign hangs under a block (the count line's "on:" lists what is under it: air under a hanging sign is expected; the ceiling is the block above)
